Gloves of Swimming and Climbing		TYPE:Wondrous Item.Glove.Attunement		WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:DMG	SLOTS:2	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_UNCOMMON	SPROP:While wearing these gloves, you have a Climb Speed and a Swim Speed equal to your Speed, and you gain a +5 bonus to Strength (Athletics) checks made to climb or swim,|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Gloves of Swimming and Climbing	DEFINE:Attunement_Gloves_Of_Swimming_And_Climbing|0	BONUS:VAR|Attunement_Gloves_Of_Swimming_And_Climbing|1	SPROP:Not attuned to Item|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Gloves of Swimming and Climbing
Gloves of Thievery		TYPE:Wondrous Item.Glove		WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:DMG	SLOTS:2	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_UNCOMMON	SPROP:These gloves are imperceptible while worn. While wearing them, you gain a +5 bonus to Dexterity (Sleight of Hand) checks.	BONUS:SKILL|Sleight of Hand|5
Goggles of the Night		TYPE:Wondrous Item.Headgear		WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:DMG	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_UNCOMMON	SPROP:While wearing these dark lenses, you have Darkvision out to 60 feet. If you already have Darkvision, wearing the goggles increases its range by 60 feet.	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Base.STACK|PREVISION:1,Darkvision=ANY	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Base|!PREVISION:1,Darkvision=ANY
Hag Eye		TYPE:Wondrous Item		WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:DMG	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_UNCOMMON.CHARGED_ITEM_3|3	SPROP:Hag Bye has 3 charges. While wearing or holding this item, you can expend 1 charge to cast Darkvision (targeting yourself only) or See Invisibility. The Hag Eye regains all expended charges daily at dawn.
