Hat of Many Spells		TYPE:Wondrous Item.Headgear.Focus.Arcane Focus.Attunement		WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:DMG	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_VERY_RARE	SPROP:This pointed hat has the following properties. &nl; Spellcasting Focus. While holding the hat, you can use it as a Spellcasting Focus for your Wizard spells. Any spell you cast using the hat gains a special Somatic component: you must reach into the hat and "pull" the spell out of it. &nl; Unknown Spell. While holding the hat, you can try to cast a level 1+ spell you don't know.|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Hat of Many Spell	DEFINE:Attunement_Hat_Of_Many_Spell|0	BONUS:VAR|Attunement_Hat_Of_Many_Spell|1	SPROP:Not attuned to Item|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Hat of Many Spell
