Heward's Handy Spice Pouch		TYPE:Wondrous Item.Bag.Attunement		WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:DMG	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_COMMON.CHARGED_ITEM_10|10	SPROP:This belt pouch appears empty and has 10 charges. While holding the pouch, you can take a Magic action to expend I charge, name any nonmagical food seasoning (such as salt, pepper, saffron, or cilantro), and remove a pinch of the desired seasoning from the pouch. A pinch is enough to season a single meal. The pouch regains 1d6 + 4 expended charges daily at dawn.
